              { "text": "No! It's his.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "Yes, please.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "I'm fine, thank you.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "想说不是、是他的，就用 No! It's his.，his 是「他的」。两个错项一个是答应请求、一个是回答身体好不好，都对不上这句话。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A2",
          "question": { "en": "Whose dog is it?", "zh": "这是谁的狗？" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A Let's learn",
          "_note": "扩充：Whose...? 提问句为本单元课标句型，非 dialogues 原句。",
          "training": {
            "type": "sentence_choice",
            "promptZh": "用英语问「这是谁的狗？」",
            "options": [
              { "text": "Whose dog is it?", "correct": true },
              { "text": "Who dog is it?", "correct": false },
              { "text": "Whose is dog it?", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "问「谁的」用 Whose，语序是 Whose + dog + is + it？错项一个把 Whose（谁的）写成了 Who（谁），一个把 is 和 dog 的顺序弄反了。"
          }
        },
        {
